<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student Portfolio Template</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f4f7f6;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #333333;
            --primary-color: #007acc;
            --secondary-color: #333333;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(450px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .projects-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
        .project-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .project-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        .project-content {
            padding: 25px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .project-title {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        .project-description {
            flex-grow: 1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #005999;
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: #555555;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding-top: 40px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }
        .contact-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        
        <header>
            <!-- STEP 1: INPUT STUDENT NAME BELOW -->
            <h1>ADEGBITE EMMANUEL</h1>
            <p>Welcome to my Github portfolio page, i'll be sharing some insightful Data analytical projects done.</p>
        </header>

        <main>
            <div class="projects-grid">

                <!-- ==================== PROJECT 1 ==================== -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <!-- INPUT: Project 1 Image Link (or local path like "images/project1.png") -->
                    <img src=https://thedigitalbanker.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Shutterstock_2160127645-Web-3.0-is-a-new-generation-of-the-Internet-using-blockchain-and-artificial-intelligence-1024x492.jpg alt="Project One Screenshot" class="project-image">
                    
                    <div class="project-content">
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 1 Title -->
                        <h2 class="project-title">Fintech and Web 3 On Chain Analysis</h2>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 1 Description -->
                        <p class="project-description">
                            This Project details a comprehensive analysis of the Ethereum blockchain to extract actionable insights regarding network health, stakeholder behavior, and cost optimization. By leveraging Google BigQuery, millions of transactions was processed to segment the market and provide a strategic roadmap for on-chain operations.
                        </p>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 1 GitHub Link -->
                        <a href=https://github.com/EmmyData26/ADEGBITE-EMMANUEL-SQL-BIGQUERY-PROJECT/tree/main/Project_one target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">View on GitHub</a>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <!-- ==================== PROJECT 2 ==================== -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <!-- INPUT: Project 2 Image Link -->
                    <img src=https://media.istockphoto.com/id/1047505000/photo/medicare-health-insurance-card.jpg?s=1024x1024&w=is&k=20&c=uO9k_Hk3jHZKMVXWzhCHJVvXbzrRncUghOhry9JXad4= alt="Project Two Screenshot" class="project-image">
                    
                    <div class="project-content">
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 2 Title -->
                        <h2 class="project-title">Medicare Analysis</h2>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 2 Description -->
                        <p class="project-description">
                           This project presents a multi-dimensional audit of the U.S. Medicare system using BigQuery. By integrating inpatient hospital charges with Part D prescription drug data, I conducted a series of statistical investigations to identify pricing discrepancies, geographic inequities, and systemic cost correlations. The goal is to provide a clear map of where healthcare spending is most concentrated and where it departs from statistical norms.
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 2 GitHub Link -->
                        <a href=https://github.com/EmmyData26/ADEGBITE-EMMANUEL-SQL-BIGQUERY-PROJECT/tree/main/Project_two target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">View on GitHub</a>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <!-- ==================== PROJECT 3 ==================== -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <!-- INPUT: Project 3 Image Link -->
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x350?text=Project+3+Image" alt="Project Three Screenshot" class="project-image">
                    
                    <div class="project-content">
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 3 Title -->
                        <h2 class="project-title">Project Title Three</h2>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 3 Description -->
                        <p class="project-description">
                            Provide a brief description of the third project here. Discuss the core technology stack used (e.g., Python, Power BI, DAX, React) and what problem this project solves for its users.
                        </p>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 3 GitHub Link -->
                        <a href="https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/PROJECT-REPOSITORY" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">View on GitHub</a>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <!-- ==================== PROJECT 4 ==================== -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <!-- INPUT: Project 4 Image Link -->
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x350?text=Project+4+Image" alt="Project Four Screenshot" class="project-image">
                    
                    <div class="project-content">
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 4 Title -->
                        <h2 class="project-title">Project Title Four</h2>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 4 Description -->
                        <p class="project-description">
                            Provide a brief description of the fourth project here. Discuss the core technology stack used (e.g., Python, Power BI, DAX, React) and what problem this project solves for its users.
                        </p>
                        
                        <!-- INPUT: Project 4 GitHub Link -->
                        <a href="https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/PROJECT-REPOSITORY" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">View on GitHub</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </main>

        <footer>
            <h2>Connect With Me</h2>
            <p>Feel free to reach out via any of the professional networks below.</p>
            <div class="contact-buttons">
                <!-- INPUT: Student's LinkedIn Profile URL -->
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/YOUR-PROFILE" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">LinkedIn</a>
                
                <!-- INPUT: Student's Main GitHub Profile URL -->
                <a href="https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">GitHub Profile</a>
                
                <!-- INPUT: Student's Contact Email Address -->
                <a href="mailto:student.email@example.com" class="btn btn-secondary">Email Me</a>
            </div>
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
